        },
        {
          "id": "q-speaking",
          "kind": "production",
          "prompt": "Ask politely for an item and respond with permission, refusal or thanks.",
          "choices": [],
          "correct_choice_ids": [],
          "answer": "A: 请问，你可不可以给我一点茶？ (Qǐngwèn, nǐ kě bu kěyǐ gěi wǒ yìdiǎn chá?) — Excuse me, could you give me some tea?\nB: 可以，给你。 (Kěyǐ, gěi nǐ.) — Yes, here you are.\nA: 谢谢！我可以在这儿喝吗？ (Xièxie! Wǒ kěyǐ zài zhèr hē ma?) — Thank you! May I drink it here?\nB: 可以。 (Kěyǐ.) — Yes, you may.",
          "explanation": "Complete sample role-play. practice both speakers, then substitute your own details."
        }
      ]
    }
  },
